        "title": "Cloud history project types gain remove semantics",
        "summary": "The shared Cloud history contract in `common/src/desktop-cloud/history.ts` now models project removal. `CloudHistoryProject` gains an optional `removedAt` timestamp indicating when a user removed a project, which is absent from older servers. `CloudHistoryProjectUpdate` changes from a single shape to a union that allows setting a name, toggling removal with a boolean flag, or both, while chats and files are retained. This type change supports a PATCH mechanism where removing a project keeps its data but excludes it from lists until a new prompt is made.",
