        "summary": "A new file in the common package defines the wire contract between the freebuff-jobs worker's `support.ingest_email` cron and the web admin route for ingesting support mail from Resend. The module exports `SupportEmailIngestRequest`, `SupportEmailIngestResponse`, and `parseSupportEmailIngestRequest`, which validates a half-open time window against `SUPPORT_EMAIL_INGEST_MAX_WINDOW_MS`. This provides a shared type definition and parser that both the worker and the Next.js route can use.",
